The issue is that when the "Show all 4 results" button (#more) is clicked, it removes itself from the DOM. The focus trap's `checkFocusIn` handler then tries to restore focus to the most recently focused node (the removed button) when focus escapes to the body. Since the button is no longer in the document, focusing it fails, and focus remains on the body instead of being trapped inside the dialog.

